{"4210660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retrovolver", "steam_appid": 4210660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking <strong>9th</strong> place in a Playstation 1 themed Game Jam, <strong>Retrovolver</strong> (formerly known as '<strong>Bandit Bill</strong>') comes to Steam with much more content In this retro inspired rouge-like first person shooter, you are an outlaw in the wild west with one thing on your mind - getting that paper. Can you survive?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: The game is in a post-game jam state, meaning content will come over time with patches as the game takes form and more ideas become clear.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Towns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start off in a procedurally generated town. You're an Outlaw so naturally, everyones gunning for you. You have some bullets to start, but you'll need to find ammo to keep shooting. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Hell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets are all projectiles with the chance to ricochet off some surfaces. As you progress to more towns and get upgrades, more bullets fly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight off waves of cowboys, sheriffs, snakes and other enemies as you explore the town to rob the people of their wealth so you can make your gun shoot better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you clear a town, a travelling trader will appear. You can buy upgrades, items and power ups from here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lootable Containers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210660/extras/eade09c5a9b1701c79109f82445ae464.avif?t=1781117727\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking <strong>9th</strong> place in a Playstation 1 themed Game Jam, <strong>Retrovolver</strong> (formerly known as '<strong>Bandit Bill</strong>') comes to Steam with much more content In this retro inspired rouge-like first person shooter, you are an outlaw in the wild west with one thing on your mind - getting that paper. Can you survive?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: The game is in a post-game jam state, meaning content will come over time with patches as the game takes form and more ideas become clear.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Towns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start off in a procedurally generated town. You're an Outlaw so naturally, everyones gunning for you. You have some bullets to start, but you'll need to find ammo to keep shooting. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Hell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets are all projectiles with the chance to ricochet off some surfaces. As you progress to more towns and get upgrades, more bullets fly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight off waves of cowboys, sheriffs, snakes and other enemies as you explore the town to rob the people of their wealth so you can make your gun shoot better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you clear a town, a travelling trader will appear. You can buy upgrades, items and power ups from here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lootable Containers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210660/extras/eade09c5a9b1701c79109f82445ae464.avif?t=1781117727\" 